	| Product | Select        | Commerce Subscription Production | |
	| Version | Select        | 1                                | |
	| Type    | Select        | Commerce Subscription Production | |''');

		ProvisioningLicense.clickChooseProductPurchaseButton(positionValue = 1);

		ProvisioningLicense.populateGenerateLicenseForm(table = '''| Name          | Input    | License3Name        | |
	| Description   | Input    | Korlic - ${staticProjectName} License3 Description | |
	| Host Name     | Input    | localhost                                          | |
